    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `consume_event.py` that consumes one message from a managed subscription or queue, I will use the Google Cloud Pub/Sub service as the concrete external provider. This service is widely used for messaging and fits the requirement of being identifiable in the code. I will import the necessary Google Cloud Pub/Sub client library and use it to create a subscriber client that pulls a single message from a specified subscription. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865005055,
          "start": 1789865002022
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc448426001x1ZGYFutCHoWFO",
